    "en": "The stories take place in a friendly anthropomorphic animal community. Characters may study, run shops, travel, and attend festivals, but they never own other sapient animals or consume meat, eggs, or species-linked by-products. Food is plant-forward and drinks are alcohol-free; aquatic characters only appear where the setting supports them."
